OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused sent homophobic
OL,4,Amessages, jury told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager murdered a gay man by
OL,7,Fpunching him, kicking him and pushing
OL,8,Fhim into a marina and leaving him to
OL,9,Fdie, a court has heard.
OL,11,FLeyton Randle, 19, of Oakfield Terrace
OL,12,FRoad, Plymouth, denies murdering Drew
OL,13,FPerham in the city in the early hours
OL,14,Fof 24 January 2026 but admits
OL,15,Fmanslaughter, accepting he attacked the
OL,16,F24-year-old and caused his death.
OL,18,FPlymouth Crown Court heard Randle did
OL,19,Fnot accept he intended to kill Perham
OL,20,For cause him really serious harm.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
